TEXT 64 2488 Left 2 !.tran 0 200m 150m 10u
TEXT 1664 2488 Left 2 !.four 1k 9 V(out)
TEXT 64 2528 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vrms RMS V(out) FROM 150m TO 200m
